meta {
  name: Rates E2E 24 - User Blocked from Cost Detail and Assignments
  type: http
  seq: 24
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/agency/rate-cards/{{costCardId}}
  body: none
  auth: none
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 403
}

docs {
  §99/§104 — the cost card DETAIL is where rates actually live; a USER gets
  403. The assignments probe (same permission) and the manage gate are
  covered by the integration suite's §98/§104 matrix; this E2E proves the
  live server enforces the privacy boundary end to end.
}
